eudpp:LandUseResult a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "An LCA result quantifying impacts associated with land occupation and transformation in a product system. \nCommonly associated with the EN 15804+A2 land use indicator (LU), which is characterised under EF 3.1. No formal quantifiesIndicator restriction is imposed; note that LU sits at the boundary between inventory and impact in EN 15804 and may be refined in future ontology versions."@en;
